------------------------------------------------------------------------
  - Beat 1 has no number and no name in it. Hooks without something checkable are the ones that get scrolled.
  - Beat(s) 4, 6 run past 4s. Either split the line or change what is on screen inside it. A static frame is where people leave.
  - Beats 3-5 have nothing concrete in them. Put a number, a name or a price in one of them.
  - No loop. The last beat shares no word with the hook, so the video ends flat. Echoing one word from beat 1 is the cheapest replay you get.
  - 5.7s under target. Either add 15 words or shoot it short. Short is usually right.

